---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getProductBrief } from '../../data/ai-products';
const briefs = [getProductBrief("client-toolbox")!];
---
<Base description="Client readiness, evidence, and review workflows, with an interactive fictional demo." title="Client Toolbox"><p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/projects/">← Projects</a></p><h1>Client Toolbox</h1><p class="intro">A shared view of client readiness. Explore a fictional portfolio and prepare a sample quarterly review.</p>{briefs.map(brief => <section class="product-context"><h2>{brief.name}</h2><p class="meta">{brief.role} · {brief.status}</p><p>{brief.tagline}</p><ul>{brief.capabilities.map(capability => <li>{capability}</li>)}</ul><p>{brief.shipped}</p><p class="meta">Production stack: {brief.stack.join(' · ')}</p></section>)}<h2>Design choices</h2><p>A score is only useful if someone can inspect its basis. The client view keeps source evidence, collection freshness, and missing information visible. Missing evidence remains a gap rather than silently becoming a passing result.</p><h2>Explore a sample</h2><p class="meta">Interactive replica of my work · Fictional data · Selected interactions</p><p><a href="/demos/client-toolbox/">Open full-screen ↗</a></p><iframe class="demo-frame" src="/demos/client-toolbox/" title="Client Toolbox interactive replica" loading="lazy"></iframe><p><a href="/years/2026/">The team’s automation process and published case study →</a></p></Base>